   "title": "read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## a video as a point cloud: filmed in depth, tracked things in 3D\n\n**You need:** a video or a picture (pick it in *Load Video*; for pictures use *Load Image*, a batch of pictures\nmorphs), the ComfyUI-DepthAnythingV3 nodes and `da3_large` in models/depthanything3 (any depth node works:\nDA3 Streaming, Depth Anything 2, Marigold - for Marigold set *near is: dark* on the point cloud).\n*kubakub point cloud* alone, with nothing connected, shows a sample facade.\n\n**Do:** pick your video, Queue once. The cloud then plays on the node: **drag** to look around, **Shift-drag** to\nmove, the **wheel** to go nearer. Find a view you like and press **end = view** (and **start = view** for where\nthe move begins); **see the move** plays it. Colours (true, mono, tint, negative), blend (glow on black, ink on\nwhite, solid), points (up to 2 million), size, depth, far cut and the motion (drift, breathe, wind, a scan through\nthe depth) change live. **render** renders only the cloud and the video after it.\n\nThe tracker (a colour, lights, people ...) puts a ring on every tracked thing at its depth, joined by lines, and its\n*near* pushes the points apart around them (*push* on the node). Disconnect what you do not need.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## a video as a point cloud: filmed in depth, tracked things in 3D\n\n**You need:** a video or a picture (pick it in *Load Video*; for pictures use *Load Image*, a batch of pictures\nmorphs), the ComfyUI-DepthAnythingV3 nodes and `da3_large` in models/depthanything3 (any depth node works:\nDA3 Streaming, Depth Anything 2, Marigold - for Marigold set *near is: dark* on the point cloud).\n*kubakub point cloud* alone, with nothing connected, shows a sample facade.\n\n**Do:** pick your video, Queue once. The cloud then plays on the node: **drag** to look around, **Shift-drag** to\nmove, the **wheel** to go nearer. Find a view you like and press **end = view** (and **start = view** for where\nthe move begins); **see the move** plays it. Colours (true, mono, tint, negative), blend (glow on black, ink on\nwhite, solid), points (up to 2 million), size, depth, far cut and the motion (drift, breathe, wind, a scan through\nthe depth) change live. **render** renders only the cloud and the video after it.\n\nThe tracker (a colour, lights, people ...) puts a ring on every tracked thing at its depth, joined by lines, and its\n*near* pushes the points apart around them (*push* on the node). Disconnect what you do not need.\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
